          "en": "Who made it?",
          "zh": "谁做它？",
          "startMs": 10180,
          "endMs": 11222
        },
        {
          "en": "This game helps the child remember what happened in the story.",
          "zh": "这个游戏帮助这孩子记得什么发生在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 11222,
          "endMs": 16604
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose one of the things the family made and ask who made it, e.",
          "zh": "• 选择一的这东西这家庭做和问谁做它， 呃。",
          "startMs": 16604,
          "endMs": 22334
        },
        {
          "en": "\"Who made jam?\"",
          "zh": "谁做拥挤？",
          "startMs": 22334,
          "endMs": 23636
        },
        {
          "en": "The child answers without looking in the book, and then checks in the book.",
          "zh": "这孩子回答没有看在……里这书， 和然后查明在……里这书。",
          "startMs": 23636,
          "endMs": 30147
        },
        {
